                                        "entry_id": "4417b680-5d37-3a6d-bd36-6d8670a013d0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A common stereotype of a blonde woman as attractive but unintelligent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory"
